docs {
  # Remove Group Member (`RemoveGroupMember`)
  
  **Handler**: `handlers.RemoveGroupMember` in [group_handler.go](file:///d:/Codes/budget-tracker/go-server/handlers/group_handler.go)
  **Route**: `DELETE /api/_private/v1/groups/:groupId/members/:userId` (Private - Bearer Token required)
  
  ### Description
  Ejects a member from the designated group:
  - Deletes the corresponding `GroupMember` record matching `:groupId` and `:userId`.
  
  ### Path Parameters
  - `groupId` (string, path parameter): Target Group ID.
  - `userId` (string, path parameter): User ID to remove.
}
